    "en": "Turns the group and its lights on or off, like the device's own Toggle card, and returns tokens. The Flow continues once every light has been sent its commands and checked once. Lights that have not confirmed yet are retried in the background. \"All lights confirmed\" and \"Status\" tell you whether that happened.",
